WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.880
Now arriving at Kibina.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:52.300
Kibina.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.390
Sorry, I'm getting off! Sorry!

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:05.470
Kibina.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.390
Come on!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.810
Walk properly!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.390
Sanada-kun!

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.110
It's because I'm sleepy!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.110
<i>I'm</i> the one who's sleepy.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.240
You're the one who made me stay up with you all night.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.610
It was educational though, right?

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.910
I'm sure that person is...

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.160
All right! We're going to do it tonight too!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.870
What? Don't hit me.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.840
Hey, onii-chan...

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.300
Maybe, our place would be better after all?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.680
Don't worry, it'll be fine.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.060
But, but...!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.390
Hey!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.770
Morning, Nana-chan!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.350
Ah! Morning, Naru-chan!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.610
Good morning, Aihara-senpai!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.360
Oh, morning.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.530
Huh? Where's Iwao-kun, Nana-chan?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.620
In order to hide it from Fuuki-san...

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.500
Me too!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.000
Geez...

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:56.790
Well then...!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.300
Oh, my lovely Juliet,

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.680
you're as beautiful as the brilliant sun this morning as well!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.060
Ah, my beloved Iwao-sama,

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.980
you are my sun!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.310
W-What the heck just started?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.900
Juliet...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.610
As proof of our eternal love...

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.190
Iwao-sama!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:23.320
A Kiss...!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.160
Onii-chan?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.750
What's wrong, onii-chan?

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.250
N-No! It's nothing!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.130
O-Of course you'd at least kiss, right?!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.510
What about a kiss?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.010
M-Mao-neechan!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:47.800
Morning!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.730
Iwao-kun and Juliet-chan are in love,

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.570
but their fathers don't get along, and won't accept their love!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.150
Just like "Romeo and Juliet."

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.110
So, that's the setting you created?

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.990
You're pretty good, Iwao-kun.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.240
You should learn from him, Kouichi.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.080
Oh well...

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:15.920
I'll see you all later!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.420
Nana,

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.960
Mao-neechan's leaving.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.960
But...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.630
I'm telling you it's fine, go on.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.550
O-Okay.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.010
What? What's going on?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.430
Actually, Nana is...

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.890
Mao-neechan!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.350
What is it, Nana-chan?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.360
Um...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:40.860
This...

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.690
Karaoke box?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.910
Days after the 7th are lucky days.
Groups of 7 people or more pay half price...

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:53.410
Today is the 11th after all. Do you want to go karaoke, Nana-chan?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.000
That's not it!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.120
I want to have a welcoming party for you, Mao-neechan!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.090
I was wondering if you like karaoke or not.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.760
But, maybe having it at home is better?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.050
Thank you, Nana-chan!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.470
Mao-neechan!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.680
Of course, I'm perfectly fine with it!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.310
All right!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.770
So, who's coming?

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.480
Only the five of us for now.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.900
Kazuki.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.770
You're coming too, Narumi-chan?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.700
Can I really come?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.240
Of course.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.410
You're more than welcome to come!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:31.740
Yes!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.870
Isn't that great, Naru-chan?

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.040
Thanks!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.120
We won't be able to get half off with only five people.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.000
We're missing two people.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.040
Two people?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.040
Kouichi! Kazuki!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.000
Y-Yes!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.800
Each of you, find one person to come along.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.130
If possible a girl.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.140
Eh?!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.430
T-That's impossible when you tell us so suddenly!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.310
How about you invite Yuumi-chan?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.520
Homeroom is going to start!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.730
We need to hurry!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.520
Let's meet up at the gates after school then.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.900
Okay!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.900
Hey, Wait!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:08.820
Geez...

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.670
I've got to invite her during lunch break.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.290
It'd be too late after school.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.010
But, what should I say to invite-

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.380
Oh? Hoshino-san!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.260
You're going to the library today for lunch break, too?

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.220
Yes, I'm on the Library Committee after all.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.220
Huh? Hoshino-san?

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.850
You sure are remarkable.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:37.890
Keep at it then.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.540
I guess coming here is pointless...

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.470
Goodbye, Aihara.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.410
I-I can't do it!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.120
I get too nervous when it comes down to it!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:45.420
All right!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.750
He's...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.350
What the heck is he doing?!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.470
E-Excuse me!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:04.940
Eh,

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.940
Sanada-kun?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.110
Hello.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.190
H-Hello, Hoshino-san.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:14.030
Ah... umm... it must be tough being a Library Committee Member.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:15.860
Really?

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:19.830
I like books, so I've never thought it was.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.660
I-I see.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.120
Yes...

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.460
Ah... Um,

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.300
Is there a book you're looking for?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.210
Ah, no!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.510
Um... About what time will you be done?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.180
Time? What do you mean?

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:42.720
Ah! I was wondering when you'd be done with your duty after school.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.850
I think I'll be done by five.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.190
I see.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.690
U-Um... do you want to... ka... ka... kara...

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.480
Kara...?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.070
He's making me angry!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.490
Just invite her already if you're a man!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.790
Do you have karate books or something?!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.120
W-What the heck are you saying?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.630
Um... So what kind of karate book are you looking for?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.510
Eh? Ah, no!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:18.050
Tell me more about it, I'll help you look for it.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.140
No, it's okay, really!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.060
It'll take time, and lunch break is short.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.140
I-I'll come again after school.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:26.890
I see.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.100
Y-Yeah. Later then.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.440
M-Mao-neechan!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.440
Onee-san?

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.280
Don't put things off you're supposed to do now until later!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.990
W-Well about that...

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.080
T-There's a time and place for everything they say.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.040
<i>Men</i> don't make excuses!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.000
I'm not making excuses-

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.040
Shut up!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.750
Wai- Mao-neechan! That hurts!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.710
Hello!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.090
Hello. Um...

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.170
I'm Mizusawa Mao, a third year.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.880
Can I have a little talk with you?

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:02.340
Sure...

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.770
A welcoming party at a karaoke box?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.230
That's right.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:13.400
It's my welcoming party and I think it's weird for me to invite you,

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:18.900
but, well, Kouichi was the one who originally wanted to invite you.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:19.650
Eh?

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.360
M-Mao-nee!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.030
Sanada-kun did?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.660
Isn't that right, Kouichi?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:28.370
Yes...

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.200
How about it?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.120
Do you have anything else after school besides library duties?

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.500
No... nothing else.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.420
Then come along with us afterwards!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.130
Come on, Kouichi, you ask her too!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.050
P-Please come!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:44.680
Um...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:45.600
But...

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.100
C-Can't you come?

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.310
Um...

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.100
If...

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.150
If you're okay with me, then...

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.360
Okay!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.940
Then it's decided! Karaoke after school!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.260
Well then...

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:26.760
To congratulate Mizusawa Mao-senpai and the others on their admittance to Kibina High School...

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:27.180
Cheers!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.310
Thank you, everyone!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.640
Why Hiiragi?

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.520
Just because we needed seven people for half off, this is...

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.190
I couldn't find anyone else, so it couldn't be helped!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.070
So how about it, Mizusawa-senpai?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:47.120
How about you join the Movie Research Club?

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.160
We'll have a grand welcoming party for you.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:55.580
There's only you, Kouichi, and Kazuki as members, right?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.500
Isn't a grand party impossible?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.670
Well, well! How harsh!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.380
It might be better if there's no one else.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:05.180
Yeah.

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.430
Can you sing this, Nana-chan?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.680
Eh? Which one?

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.270
It's this song.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.350
Yeah, I can sing it.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.390
Really? Then will you sing with me?

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:22.680
kokoro no DOA o ima hiraite mitai no

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:22.680
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:27.180
kimi dakeni。。。

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:27.180
Only you...

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.640
KISS。。。todoke。。。

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.640
my kiss will reach...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.410
You're really good, Mao-neechan!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.000
Thank you!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.040
Awesome!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.510
Sorry, I'm going out for a bit.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.220
Huh? Where to?

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.430
Geez, Kouichi.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.010
Don't ask things like that.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.430
Do you want to come to the w-a-s-h-r-o-o-m with me?

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.350
S-Sorry!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.560
Well, I'll be going now!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.700
So you were here, Yuumi-chan.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.910
I thought you were going to sing after me,

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:10.950
but you weren't there.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.200
Sorry.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.500
You don't like karaoke?

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:16.870
No...

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.830
I've never sung in front of other people before.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.130
Then, how about singing with me?

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.760
Ah... That's...

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.880
Or, would you rather sing with Kouichi?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.010
Eh?!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.890
U-Um...

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.440
Hmm?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.770
U-Um...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.190
W-What are you to...

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.900
Sanada-kun...?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.450
I guess I'm something like a childhood friend to Kouichi.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.620
Same with Kazuki and Nana-chan.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.200
Is that so?

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:00.170
I'm the oldest among them, so I'm something like a sister.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:01.830
So...

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.960
When my little brother is interested in a girl,

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.300
as his sister, I become interested too.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.180
Get along with Kouichi, okay?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.260
Okay.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.470
Hold on for a bit.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:18.980
Let's go back together.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:22.440
Okay!

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:28.030
ii shikuna koi no kakushi aki wa chouto

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:28.030
Listen. Don't spread my hidden love. There's a lot of time to spare and,

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:34.100
watashi ni wa hayai kamon terechau

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:34.100
It's a bit too fast for me and I'm shy.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.720
asa kara yo RUMA de

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.720
Tomorrow's rumors,

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.370
me wo hanasanai de

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.370
don't take your eyes off of them.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.280
kotokoto to niko nara

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:49.280
If there are whisperings and smiles,

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.970
futari no koi no aji dekiru kana

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.970
will the two of us be able to taste love?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.900
Now Calculating Score

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:05.400
Points!!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.400
91 points!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.440
We did it!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:09.900
They beat us...

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.820
Who'd have thought they would get that many points?!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:16.030
You promised you'd show us if we got over 90 points.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.120
You should keep your promises.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.620
It can't be helped. Let's do it, Kouichi.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.920
Why do I have to do this?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.880
And then, at that time, Kouichi...

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.420
Healing Beam!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.340
I'm being healed!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.800
What are you doing...?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.760
The Healing Beam!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.930
But, it's not cute at all when they do it.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.560
They were better as the bear and gorilla.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.910
That was so much fun!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.200
It must be when you sing 20 songs yourself.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.200
It's okay!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.870
It's my welcoming party after all!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.330
Excuse me, it's about time I...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.330
Sorry for making you stay out with us so late.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.540
Where do you live, Yuumi-chan?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.050
I commute to school by train.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.550
I see.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.930
Then I'll make him take you to the station.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.100
Hey! Mao-neechan!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.020
If you don't mind, then...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:27.190
I... don't mind...

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.190
Hmm... I see.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.490
W-What is it, Hiiragi?!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.700
No, nothing at all.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.530
Just your imagination.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.070
L-Let's go, Hoshino-san!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.490
O-Okay...

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.870
Um... Thank you very much for today!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:48.830
It was a lot of fun.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.460
See you later!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.340
All right then, let's break up, everyone!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.050
Yes! See you tomorrow!

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.060
I wonder if things are going well for Kouichi?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:14.690
Geez... dealing with a little brother's love affair isn't easy.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.410
What are you doing here, Kai-kun?!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.420
What? I'm putting out the sign.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.250
Not that!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.630
What I'm asking is...

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.420
In exchange for helping out the store,

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:38.970
they let me use their equipment and practice before opening.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.970
You mean your sax?

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.050
Yeah.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:45.140
What is it?

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:46.390
No...

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.230
I just thought that was wonderful.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:50.850
Eh?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.400
Hey, Eiji!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:54.650
What are you doing?

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.480
Sorry! I'm coming now!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.280
Hey!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.030
Sorry for bothering you!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.410
Let me hear you perform next time!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:20.380
Kibina Station

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.180
I'm sorry, Hoshino-san.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.050
Eh?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.430
I kind of forced you to come.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.720
No, that's not true.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:30.020
I'm just not used to getting together with others and doing things,

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.560
so I was nervous.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.860
I-I see.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.650
I had a lot of fun today though.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.690
R-Really? Then that's great.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.700
Yes, I got to see your beam too.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.160
If it's possible, please forget that.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:53.080
The next train will be on platform 2 at 21:00 and will be waiting for one minute.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.500
Destination: Satomiyuki.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:56.380
Sanada-kun...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.050
Thank you for bringing me here.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.090
I-It was nothing.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.720
The train is going to come soon, so...

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.260
O-Okay.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:06.810
Bye.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.410
Hoshino-san!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.290
Sanada-kun...

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.840
H-Hoshino-san! Um...

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:38.380
What is it?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:42.630
Can... Can I talk to you more from now on?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.640
Like during class... and breaks...

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.260
A-And after school and...

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:56.860
Yes.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.070
D-Does that mean...

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.530
Kibina. Kibina.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.530
Thank you for today, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:27.930
Yes!

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
kowaresou de

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
I won’t forget

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
that wish upon a star.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
The fruit

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
naite sawaida

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
osaekirenai

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
kowaresou de

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
I won’t forget

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
that wish upon a star.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Episode

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.050
Kouichi sure is doing well.

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:29.920
All right, I'm going to do my best too!

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:32.450
Wait! What's the point in doing my best for soccer practice?!

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.490
Why does that Saki always drag me around?

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.470
I want to talk once more with Futami-san!
